index dcc6983..80372df 100644
--- a/docs/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/docs/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -21,6 +21,8 @@ and this project adheres to [Semantic Versioning](https://semver.org/spec/v2.0.0
 
 ### Fixed
 
+- **Union member navigation keeps every declaration.** Go to Definition offers each matching method or property instead of choosing one union alternative. Shared inherited declarations appear once. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream build).
+
 - **Built-in function suggestions respect their PHP introduction version.** Functions introduced after the project target stay out of completion and lazy stub caches; user polyfills remain available. Contributed by PHP Workbench downstream.
 
 - **Named-argument signature help.** Reordered named arguments highlight their declared parameter, including named variadic values. Contributed by PHP Workbench (local downstream build).
